  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675914",
      "title": "Loaders - A Closer Look",
      "lectureOrder": 69,
      "videoOrder": 63,
      "sourceHash": "e719365de992d1002c705452c71bac0205c70f83d8527d8d566b7ad139029d5e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.34,
          "en": "Now before we proceed with this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.34,
          "end": 7.5,
          "en": "with this demo and with more features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.5,
          "end": 10.53,
          "en": "I got another note related to loaders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.53,
          "end": 12.99,
          "en": "The value returned by this loader here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.99,
          "end": 15.57,
          "en": "as mentioned before in this case is a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.57,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "that then yields our array of expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 22.08,
          "en": "This is something you can absolutely return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.08,
          "end": 24.75,
          "en": "because as you see, it works just fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.75,
          "end": 26.49,
          "en": "However, in your loaders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.49,
          "end": 30.273,
          "en": "you can also return responses instead of raw data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.23,
          "end": 33.84,
          "en": "So here I could, for example, turn this back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.84,
          "end": 37.02,
          "en": "into async function to get my expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "by waiting the call to get expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "and then instead of returning the expenses like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 46.14,
          "en": "which is essentially what we did before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.14,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "I can also return a response generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 53.28,
          "en": "with help of the json utility function provided by Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.28,
          "end": 56.013,
          "en": "which is imported from at Remix run node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 61.88,
          "en": "And then here to json, I can pass my expenses like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 69.41,
          "en": "If I save that and I reload, I get the same result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 72.87,
          "en": "as before because this is essentially what Remix does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.87,
          "end": 77.07,
          "en": "behind the scenes with the raw data I returned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "If you return raw data, Remix the text that it's raw data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 82.56,
          "en": "and it wraps it into a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "because technically your loader must return a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 89.94,
          "en": "to the front-end or to the process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.94,
          "end": 91.503,
          "en": "that renders this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.58,
          "end": 96.78,
          "en": "The response then automatically unpacked for you by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.78,
          "end": 98.37,
          "en": "So here in your component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 100.53,
          "en": "you then get the raw data again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.53,
          "end": 103.41,
          "en": "but between loader and this component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.41,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "the data is basically wrapped into a response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 108.12,
          "en": "which should make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.12,
          "end": 111.15,
          "en": "because the loader code runs on the back-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.15,
          "end": 114.9,
          "en": "The component code runs potentially on the front-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.9,
          "end": 117.33,
          "en": "And that's also important to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.33,
          "end": 118.743,
          "en": "I said potentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.58,
          "end": 123.03,
          "en": "And we can see that it runs on different ends.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.03,
          "end": 128.013,
          "en": "If I simply output rendering expenses layout here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.97,
          "end": 132.78,
          "en": "if I output this here and I then reload this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.78,
          "end": 135.84,
          "en": "which shows my list of expenses, you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.84,
          "end": 137.73,
          "en": "that I got this log output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.73,
          "end": 141.32999999999998,
          "en": "in this terminal where I started the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.32999999999998,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "Now, anything being logged here is logged by the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 145.98,
          "en": "so by the back-end code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.98,
          "end": 149.04,
          "en": "So this clearly ran on the back-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.04,
          "end": 151.41,
          "en": "If I open my front-end developer code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 153.27,
          "en": "and take a look at the console there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.27,
          "end": 156.03,
          "en": "I also see it being locked there though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.03,
          "end": 158.34300000000002,
          "en": "So the code also ran on the front-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.45,
          "end": 163.62,
          "en": "The reason for that is that Remix prepares this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.62,
          "end": 166.8,
          "en": "and page on the back-end and serves it to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.8,
          "end": 170.79,
          "en": "but thereafter, we're back in a single page application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.79,
          "end": 173.25,
          "en": "If I would, for example, go back to the starting page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "and load this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 178.35,
          "en": "and then click get started to be taken to the expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.35,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "I see the log here on the front-end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 182.19,
          "en": "and I see it multiple times because we're",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.19,
          "end": 184.86,
          "en": "in development mode, so don't worry about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.86,
          "end": 186.16,
          "en": "But I see the log here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.11,
          "end": 189.63,
          "en": "but I now don't see the log on the back-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.63,
          "end": 191.07,
          "en": "This is still the old log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.07,
          "end": 195.33,
          "en": "There was no new rendering expenses layout log thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.33,
          "end": 196.95,
          "en": "The reason for that is that I was",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 198.81,
          "en": "in a single page application already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 202.07999999999998,
          "en": "and therefore Remix just fetched the code behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.07999999999998,
          "end": 204.39,
          "en": "So it executed the loader on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.39,
          "end": 207.12,
          "en": "but it did not render the component on the server again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.12,
          "end": 209.49,
          "en": "because this was not the initial page fetch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.49,
          "end": 212.733,
          "en": "but a subsequent navigation in my single page application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.69,
          "end": 215.97,
          "en": "With that, we get the best of both worlds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.97,
          "end": 218.01,
          "en": "If we first visit a page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.01,
          "end": 219.78,
          "en": "the page is prepared on the back-end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.78,
          "end": 222.9,
          "en": "and the finished page is served to the client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.9,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "which means that if the client is a search engine crawler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "for example, that crawler sees the finished page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 232.95,
          "en": "which is better for a search engine optimization.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.95,
          "end": 235.59,
          "en": "But if we are on the page already on the website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.59,
          "end": 237.69,
          "en": "and we navigate to a different page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.69,
          "end": 240.24,
          "en": "then we simply fetch the data behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.24,
          "end": 242.79,
          "en": "and we don't fetch the entire document again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.79,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "which is now more efficient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 246.33,
          "en": "So Remix ensures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.33,
          "end": 249.03,
          "en": "that the most efficient route is being taken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.03,
          "end": 250.83,
          "en": "but it is important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.83,
          "end": 252.81,
          "en": "that this component code can run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.81,
          "end": 255.33,
          "en": "on both the back-end and the front-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.33,
          "end": 258.45,
          "en": "Therefore, you must not use any server side code in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.45,
          "end": 260.52,
          "en": "because it could run on the front-end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.52,
          "end": 263.64,
          "en": "and you also must not use any front-end exclusive code there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.64,
          "end": 266.373,
          "en": "either because it could run on the back-end as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.57,
          "end": 270.03,
          "en": "The loader on the upper hand is always executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 270.03,
          "end": 272.85,
          "en": "on the back-end, never on the front-end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 272.85,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "And I'm just stressing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.29,
          "end": 276.81,
          "en": "because it is important to understand where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.81,
          "end": 280.92,
          "en": "which code executes and how these things behave.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.92,
          "end": 284.79,
          "en": "That's also why the loader must return a response because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.79,
          "end": 286.56,
          "en": "since it always runs on the back-end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286.56,
          "end": 287.85,
          "en": "but the component code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 287.85,
          "end": 291.18,
          "en": "where the data is used potentially runs only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 291.18,
          "end": 294.51,
          "en": "on the front-end, data must be exchanged with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 294.51,
          "end": 298.263,
          "en": "of a response between loader and component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.46,
          "end": 301.95,
          "en": "That's why you should return a response here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.95,
          "end": 304.8,
          "en": "but you can also just return the raw data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 304.8,
          "end": 307.41,
          "en": "because as mentioned, Remix will detect this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 307.41,
          "end": 310.023,
          "en": "and wrap this data into a response for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 313.5,
          "en": "That's why the code we had before works as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 313.5,
          "end": 316.08,
          "en": "which essentially returns a promise that yields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 316.08,
          "end": 319.5,
          "en": "that raw data, but behind the scenes it will be wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 319.5,
          "end": 323.31,
          "en": "into a response, and it's just important to understand this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 323.31,
          "end": 325.76,
          "en": "which is why I wanted to highlight it here again.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
